Original work made for Selecta by I430, no upstream song: furnace_test.fur is a 32-row pattern (speed 6 at 60 Hz = 3.2 s) with four square notes on the first SN76489 channel of the default Genesis setup. Generated with Furnace's own saveFur() by a short scratch program (DivEngine headless), then checked into the repository under the Selecta MIT licence. The Furnace demo songs are all rights reserved and are deliberately not used.
